    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by leveraging our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing certifications, security practices, and experience with data protection tools, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is well-positioned to meet the client's demands for strict GDPR compliance, secure hosting within EU, and high-level data security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with regulatory requirements in force, including GDPR and environmental regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client also emphasizes sovereignty of data and low carbon impact infrastructures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I have reviewed we company context and the tender requirements. we need to flag the following legal risks:  1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "GDPR compliance: As we will be handling personal data, we must ensure that we processes and systems comply with GDPR. our company context indicates that we have a standard legal basis for processing personal data under Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR and that we provide support for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should confirm that we specific implementation for this project meets these requirements. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental regulations: The client emphasizes the importance of low carbon impact infrastructures and limiting the environmental footprint of The client systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our company context does not explicitly mention environmental policies or procedures, we do have a requirement to propose an approach to optimize costs and reduce energetic consumption. we should ensure that we solution aligns with these environmental goals. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty of data: The client requires that data be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union and protected in an appropriate manner using encryption and anonymization if necessary. our company context indicates that we are established in the European Union and have experience working within the European Union jurisdictions, which should support compliance with requires. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory compliance: More broadly, the client requires compliance with regulatory requirements in force. our company context mentions that we have checked for exclusion grounds related to criminal convictions, tax or social security irregularities, grave professional misconduct, conflicts of interest, and insolvency or liquidation proceedings, and that we have no such issues." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must ensure that we specific implementation for this project complies with all relevant regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of compliance, based on our company context: - we appear to be generally compliant with GDPR requirements, given we experience with public procurement in the European Union jurisdictions and we standard legal basis for processing personal data. - For environmental regulations, while we do not have explicit policies mentioned, we goal to propose an approach to optimize costs and reduce energetic consumption suggests some alignment with the client's environmental goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should provide specific details on how our solution will achieve low carbon impact. - Regarding sovereignty of data, as an the European Union company with experience working within the European Union jurisdictions, we are well-positioned to comply with the requirement for hosting data exclusively within the European Union. - For regulatory compliance, we lack of exclusion grounds and we experience with public procurement suggest a strong foundation for compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must ensure that all aspects of our solution meet the specific regulatory requirements applicable to this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To fully address the client's requirements and mitigate legal risks, we should: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Confirm we GDPR compliance measures specifically for this project. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Provide detailed information on how our solution will achieve low carbon impact and support environmental goals. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Emphasize we commitment to hosting data within the European Union and protecting data appropriately. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ensure that all regulatory requirements are met and explicitly state we compliance in our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By taking these steps, we can demonstrate we compliance with the client's regulatory, environmental, and data sovereignty requirements while minimizing legal risks associated with this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide intelligent assistance to agents, integrate with existing systems, and propose a reduction of energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we leverage we AI capabilities to meet these requirements and what innovation strategies can we propose to improve the efficiency of administrative services?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, we can leverage we AI capabilities in natural language processing and machine learning to develop an intelligent assistance tool that provides contextualized answers to agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our experience with large language models such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, and CamemBERT can be utilized to create a customized model that integrates with the existing system of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned using Our LoRA and QLoRA methods to achieve an average accuracy gain of 12%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
