    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering proposes an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents administrative activities, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will be designed to integrate with existing systems of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories, ensuring a seamless transition for agents. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will be capable of searching for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation, providing help with drafting letters or answers to users, and instructing files. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will also suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process, facilitating continuity of the processing of files between agents and services." ;
