    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client demands for strict GDPR compliance, hosting on EU territory, encryption, anonymization, and high-level security, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can leverage our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing certifications and capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. hold ISO 27001 certification, which demonstrates our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. commitment to information security management. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. scope includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, which is relevant to this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
