        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, and a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed contact information is dpo@nexus-engineering.it. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have experience with anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models, which can be used to protect personal data in accordance with GDPR principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For hosting, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. need to ensure that all data is hosted exclusively on EU territory. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency policy already stipulates that data should reside in EU, aligning with stipulates." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To prevent unauthorized access or breaches, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. implement robust security measures including multi-factor authentication (MFA) using TOTP and hardware tokens (FIDO2), Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) design experience, and Privileged Access Management (PAM) solutions like CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. network security architecture is based on zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defence-in-depth patterns, which provides a robust defense against various types of attacks. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also conduct annual penetration tests (and post-major releases) with partners like Synacktiv and HN Security to identify and remediate vulnerabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection specifically, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "AI security controls include prompt injection protection, output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, confidence threshold escalation, model isolation through inference API only, and a thorough security review of model updates. our AI security controls help protect against unauthorized access or manipulation of sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these capabilities, the potential risks associated with meeting these requirements seem manageable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, one risk could be ensuring seamless integration with existing systems while maintaining high security standards, which might require additional resources or time for testing and validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another risk is the dependency on specific anonymization tools or encryption methods that might evolve over time, requiring updates to our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
